X06A01 ~r~Bandit:~w~ Shots in the village! Cut off the road, take them from the flank!
X06A02 ~g~The village is burning.~w~ Hold your position and watch the ridge.
X06A03 A ~r~wounded bandit~w~ is stumbling back up the road. Finish him.
X06A04 ~g~Area clear.~w~ Nothing moves among the flames.
X06A05 ~g~All hostiles down.~w~ Do not leave yet, check the camp.
